DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The llllddpp program communicates with the lldpd(8) Link Layer Discovery Pro‐
     tocol (LLDP) agent to fetch and display LLDP entries received by the
     agent.

     The options are as follows:

     --ii _i_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e
             Limit the LLDP entries to those received on the specified
             _i_n_t_e_r_f_a_c_e.

     --ss _s_o_c_k_e_t
             Use _s_o_c_k_e_t to communicate with lldpd(8).

     --vv      Increase the verbosity of output.

FFIILLEESS
     /var/run/lldp.sock  default lldpd(8) control socket

